# Claude merges its own pull requests once they are reviewed and green, but a
# change to how work is checked, merged or deployed needs @starquake's
# approval: the ruleset requires a code owner's review (#373, decision 8).
# Only the forms .claude/scripts/merge-gate.sh parses: /dir/, /path, and a
# bare name, which matches at any depth.
/.github/ @starquake
/deployments/ @starquake
/.claude/ @starquake
/.mcp.json @starquake
# Claude Code also loads a CLAUDE.md in any directory.
CLAUDE.md @starquake
